invalid type: string "When to Use Which Channel\n●\nUrgent, needs a response within the hour: Slack DM or @here in a relevant channel.\n●\nNeeds a decision but not urgent: post in the team channel and tag the decision-maker.\n●\nLong-form context or a proposal: write a Notion doc and share the link.\n●\nExplaining something visual or complex: record a Loom instead of a long message.\n.\n��